# TripMate Client Environment Configuration (Vite)

# Backend Render API URL
# Development: http://localhost:5000
# Production: https://<your-backend-render-name>.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

# Backend Render Socket.IO URL
# Development: http://localhost:5000
# Production: https://<your-backend-render-name>.onrender.com
VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:5000
